    <h1>Request Templates</h1>
    <p>
      Model public records request letters for filing under the Nebraska Public Records Act,
      organized by agency type. Adapt for the specific agency and date range before filing.
      Submit via <a href="https://www.muckrock.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MuckRock</a>
      or directly to the agency's designated records custodian.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

